{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "forcing_2d_gridded",
    "description": "A 2-D gridded tracer forced by two handler-fed fields: emis on [x, y] and wind on [y]. col[j] = sum_i emis[i, j] and frac[i, j] = emis[i, j] / col[j] read only forcing, so a compiler that caches state-free work between calls must refresh them when the forcing changes and only then. D(q[i, j]) = frac[i, j] * (1 + 0.01 t) - k q[i, j] + wind[j] (q[i-1, j] - q[i, j]): forcing through an observed, forcing times state, a scalar parameter, t, and an upwind read whose cell-1 neighbour is an out-of-domain zero ghost. D(total) = kd * sum q reduces the whole state.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciAST test suite"
    ],
    "created": "2026-10-25T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": [
      "conformance",
      "public_rhs_program"
    ]
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "x": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 6
    },
    "y": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 5
    }
  },
  "models": {
